# ADT tag-only variants: [type "ok" "err" "pending"] produces a Union of
# 3 StringLiteral members. At runtime, the type dict is empty (no constructors
# for string-literal variants); the type alias itself evaluates to an empty dict.
[
  Status: [type "ok" "err" "pending"]
  current: "ok"
]
=== out
["Status": []  "current": "ok"]
